sequenceDiagram
    participant API as FastAPI startup/request
    participant R as Versioned registry
    participant M as Model manager
    participant P as Private artifact bundle
    participant A as Verified inference adapter
    API->>R: Read selected model metadata
    R-->>M: ID, version, threshold, calibration, hashes
    M->>M: Contain paths under approved model directory
    M->>P: Check files and verify SHA-256 hashes
    M->>P: Validate manifest and compatibility metadata
    P-->>A: Trusted pipeline and vectorizer
    A-->>API: Finite class probabilities
    Note over M,P: Missing, mismatched, inactive, or unsafe artifacts fail closed
